                            	  2995: 
                            	  2996: * get value from line .. continued
                            	  2997: * only functions left so set up function references
                            	  2998: 
                            	  2999: * new for V2.0+ this replaces a lot of IF .. THEN .. ELSEIF .. THEN .. that was needed
                            	  3000: * to process function calls. now the function vector is computed and pushed on the stack
                            	  3001: * and the preprocess offset is read. if the preprocess offset is non zero then the vector
                            	  3002: * is calculated and the routine called, if not this routine just does RTS. whichever
                            	  3003: * happens the RTS at the end of this routine, or the preprocess routine calls, the
                            	  3004: * function code
                            	  3005: 
