01:000846FA 4A2B05B5        	  7432: 	TST.b		Dtypef(a3)			* test data type
01:000846FE 6B00DA40        	  7433: 	BMI		LAB_TMER			* if string do Type missmatch Error/warm start
                            	  7434: 
